# Build context for docker/liara-documentation-builder/Dockerfile.
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs only tools/, docker/scripts/, astro/, and
# modules-registry.json — everything below is genuinely unused at build
# time and would otherwise be uploaded to the docker daemon for nothing
# (node_modules especially, which is sizeable and gets reinstalled inside
# the image regardless via `npm ci`).

.git
.github
.idea
.vscode

docs
hub
tests

node_modules
dist
.astro

*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*.DS_Store
